[00:13.96]Sarah and Esther, Mary, Ruth, and others—
[00:21.54]All these were capable women, loyal wives.
[00:29.74]Godly devotion was foremost in their lives.
[00:37.04]They were faithful women, ones we know by name.
[00:43.51]There were others favored by Jehovah;
[00:49.90]Nameless in the record, their faith was just the same.
[00:58.16]Goodness and courage, loyal love and kindness—
[01:06.25]Lovable qualities in all humankind,
[01:14.47]Virtues these excellent women bring to mind.
[01:21.99]They were fine examples we appreciate.
[01:28.89]In the same way now our Christian sisters
[01:33.40]Show a faithful spirit we all can imitate.
[01:46.92]Mothers and daughters, sisters, wives, and widows,
[01:53.53]Willingly laboring, glad to do your part.
[02:03.08]Modest your bearing, submissive is your heart,
[02:10.88]Having God’s approval, may you never fear.
[02:18.96]Christian sisters, may Jehovah keep you
[02:22.60]Firm in your conviction, your prize is drawing near.
